  <div class="question" data-question>
    <p class="q">Q3. You boot with <code>isolcpus=4-7 nohz_full=4-7</code> and pin the strategy thread to core 5. Which of the following is the most important consequence?</p>
    <ul class="options">
      <li data-correct="false" data-why="The CPU runs the same frequency regardless of isolcpus. Frequency scaling is governed by separate config (cpufreq governor, intel_pstate).">Core 5 automatically runs at a higher clock frequency.</li>
